# Keeping the build context small is secondary here. The first purpose is making sure no
# local secret or key material is ever copied into an image layer, where it would survive
# every later deletion.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/
publish/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/

tests/
docs/
deploy/
*.md

# Secrets and key material — never in an image.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.snk
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.escrow
keystore/
filestore/
pgdata/
